WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.300
<i>A kingdom concealed in darkness, Deltora.</i>

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.650
<i>A royal heirloom, the Belt of Deltora.</i>

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.000
<i>Long ago, in this belt fashioned by the first king,</i>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.750
<i>Seven gems were placed.</i>

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.600
<i>The gems possessed magical powers,</i>

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.350
<i>And were protected while the king's direct descendants wore the belt.</i>

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:33.150
<i>But, those gems were hidden in seven mystical lands.</i>

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>Since then, the kingdom of Deltora has been shrouded in darkness.</i>

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:42.700
<i>However,</i>

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.200
<i>The light of hope can be seen on the horizon.</i>

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:51.000
<i>Standing against the Shadow Lord, there is a boy who is on a quest to search for the seven gems.</i>

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:55.000
<i>With light and hope at their side,</i>

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.400
<i>They are off on their adventure.</i>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:14.170
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.060
A brand new world is beginning
Ima hajimarunda

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:24.640
Even if there are painful things ahead
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:31.040
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:38.800
I'm starting to walk in a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:45.030
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:48.250
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.380
And there's no one who can stop it
Darenimo tomerarenai

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.400
My heart is tightening and out of control
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.760
So start flapping your wings from here
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.810
And soar high up into the sky
Ano sora he to takaku

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:09.780
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:13.110
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:16.380
That's what I believed
Sou shinjiteiru no

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:21.540
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:44.800
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:58.050
Lief!

00:02:58.050 --> 00:02:59.130
Get to shore!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.800
This is all that's left, huh...

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.400
They've been completely submerged in dirt.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:29.900
Lief.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:34.000
You're sure that the gem is here, right?

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:34.600
Yeah.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:38.200
The belt is still hot; there's no mistaking it.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:41.300
The gem is somewhere in this lake.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:46.700
<i>"How are we going to find the gem in this muddy lake?"</i>

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:51.600
<i>"What if we return to Raladin and get all the tools we need?"</i>

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:57.450
<i>"But, excavating would take too long, and Soldeen wouldn't exactly stay quiet about it."</i>

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:06.100
<i>"What if one of us kept him distracted while the others dive into the lake from the opposite shore and search for the gem?"</i>

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:12.500
<i>"But, it's probable that Soldeen would turn around and attack the rest."</i>

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.300
None of those work, then...

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:23.700
<i>This land's negative energy has seeped into them.</i>

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.000
Manus,

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.900
Play your flute.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:31.400
Something... Yeah, something fun.

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.200
The flute? At a time like this?

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:39.400
It's exactly <i>because</i>  we're at a time like this.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:05.000
<i>The melody was like an upbeat wave, and the death- filled atmosphere was blown away.</i>

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:11.900
<i>They could picture a crystal-clear river flowing through the cool shade of trees,</i>

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:17.900
<i>And in the green forest the birds were singing and children were playing innocently.</i>

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:22.400
<i>The flowers were growing in great numbers toward the sun.</i>

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:26.300
<i>Manus' music created such an image for them.</i>

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:27.800
Right...

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.000
I have the topaz.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:40.100
The topaz is at its maximum potential during the full moon.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.000
The full moon?

00:05:42.900 --> 00:05:44.500
Maximum potential?

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:51.540
I wonder what 'maximum potential' means...

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:55.800
Soldeen!

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.100
Don't stop.

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:00.000
Keep playing.

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:02.600
Hurry up!

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.700
For what reason did you all come here?

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.400
Don't stop!

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.800
Keep playing.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:24.400
Answer me.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:27.300
What is your goal?

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:32.100
We're here to find a certain gem.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:35.500
To us, it's a very special gem.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:36.710
A gem?

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:40.650
It fell from the sky and into this lake.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.500
It happened 16 years ago.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.400
And no matter what, we need that gem!

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:48.650
I am aware of this gem.

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.300
Where is it?

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.210
I have it.

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:58.100
I received it.

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:02.800
It comforts me as I continue to live in this sad place.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:08.700
Do you think I would hand over something so special? For nothing in return?

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:11.300
Is there anything you would want instead?

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:14.600
If it's something we can give, then request anything.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.500
Very well!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:24.000
I will give it to you. In exchange, give him to me.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.240
I like the melody he plays.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:28.600
No way!

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:33.750
Now, come this way; to the centre of the lake where the rock of tears sits.

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:42.500
For as long as you live, day and night, you will ease my heart by playing your flute!

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:45.700
Manus!

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:48.800
You can't, Manus!

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:54.100
Isn't it clear that he wants to come here?

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:56.400
Why don't you let him do as he pleases?

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:58.900
You've got to be kidding. We're not giving him to you!

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:01.100
Give him to me...

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:03.900
Otherwise I'll kill you all!

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:05.500
Try it if you can!

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:10.830
Lief!

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:18.200
How's that?

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.800
We're not letting you have Manus!

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:24.900
His people were treated so poorly and were finally released.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:28.500
And yet he chose to come all this way with us.

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:31.900
We're not going to let you kill anyone, no matter what!

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:48.100
Are you saying that you're going to sacrifice your life for him?

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:53.400
He tried to sacrifice his life for all of you!

00:08:54.200 --> 00:09:01.900
Long ago... A very long time ago, something similar happened...?

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.300
Soldeen is...!

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:09.000
Something is happening to me!

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.800
My heart is being cleansed!

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.300
The topaz!

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:19.200
The full moon... I see!

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:22.200
The light of the full moon is fueling the topaz!

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.600
I can see it.

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:27.000
When was that... where...?

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.400
That's my...

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:45.900
What?! What kind of spell have you cast on me?

00:09:45.900 --> 00:09:47.300
It's not a spell.

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:49.300
The topaz has shown you the truth!

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:53.500
What you saw just now is the truth!

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:03.100
My heart is being cleansed...!

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:19.900
What... What is your wish?

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:20.840
The gem.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:24.550
Please, give me the gem...

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:30.200
So you can change back to who you were; so you can regain what you've lost.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:33.300
Very well.

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:54.200
That is what you were looking for, is it not?

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:57.600
A pink gem?

00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:02.140
A pink gem doesn't exist among the seven gems of Deltora...

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:05.300
<i>Lief thought it to be strange,</i>

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:11.000
<i>But, given the belt's reaction, there was was no mistaking that this was the gem.</i>

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.200
<i>Then, why was it this colour?</i>

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:17.100
What is it? Why are you not satisfied?

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:19.000
No, it's nothing.

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:20.600
Let's go back.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.400
Look, they're coming back!

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:31.600
It's the gem! He got it!

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:35.800
But Lief looks strange; he doesn't seem too happy about it.

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:38.400
The emerald is green.

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:40.400
The amethyst is purple.

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:44.300
The lapis lazuli is blue speckled with silver.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:47.100
The opal is multicoloured.

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:49.800
The diamond is clear as ice...

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:51.300
And the ruby is red.

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.000
Ruby?

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:57.000
<i>"The great ruby is blood red."</i>

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.100
<i>"It represents happiness."</i>

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:05.000
<i>"But, when it senses evil, its colour starts to fade."</i>

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:07.000
If red starts to fade, it turns pink!

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:09.700
Soldeen, watch out!

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.500
Something evil is near!

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:21.400
Lief!

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:33.700
Welcome to my garden.

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:40.600
I am the Sorceress...

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.600
Thaegan!

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:59.000
Sorceress Thaegan!

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:06.000
Rae Exalaedus Demi Dominum Sedola...

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:07.600
Thaegan!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.100
How cute.

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:28.300
Even after you have invaded my garden and released my bird slave, you're still trying to release another of my slaves?

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:34.000
On top of that, look at what you did to Jin and Jod.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.600
How awful of you.

00:13:37.100 --> 00:13:40.200
Raia Laia Sedones Thaegan!

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:50.430
You see that?

00:13:51.200 --> 00:13:53.800
Each of you will become my eternal slaves!

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:55.400
Lief!

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:57.400
I-I'm okay.

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:00.300
Get it together!

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:03.200
Can you stand?

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:04.500
Y-Yeah.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:07.400
How very cute.

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:11.000
You're so worth hurting!

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.200
Damned witch!

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:16.700
Shit!

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:20.000
You're so cute being all serious.

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:28.500
Oh my, you're my favourite black bird.

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:31.000
Later on, I'll be sure to devour you nice and slow.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:32.600
Your opponent is me!

00:14:34.400 --> 00:14:35.700
Jasmine!

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:42.900
One drop. Just one drop is all I need...

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:48.000
To defeat her, I just need to get her to shed a single drop of blood.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:50.000
We have to get through her defence!

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.300
Thaegan!

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:54.800
Lief!

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:02.000
A magic cloak?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.000
Interesting thing you have there.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:04.700
Lief!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:07.900
I've got it.

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:10.100
I know how to defeat her.

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:12.200
It's at the moment she casts her spell.

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:15.800
Before she finishes casting it, there's an opening in her defence!

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:20.200
Let's end this now, shall we?

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:26.000
A Ralad man?

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:29.200
Your flute has no power.

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:36.200
I'll draw her to me, then with your dagger...!

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:37.600
Stop it!

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:40.200
Shall I make you unable to play that flute?

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:41.200
Let's go!

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:43.500
Thaegan!

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.400
Hemngwin Geralemdes...

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:48.200
Thae...

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:48.900
Jasmine!

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:51.200
...gan!

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:56.400
Lief!

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:01.000
Damn you.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.000
No more holding back.

00:16:03.000 --> 00:16:05.500
I'm going to turn you all into monsters!

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:09.700
Then your ugly forms can crawl in the mud for all eternity!

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:14.600
Iaeran Iraes Zekksem

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:16.300
Thaegan!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.500
Kree...

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:43.700
This can't be, no!

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:45.200
There's no way!!

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:56.600
Let's get out of here!

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:34.900
Look!

00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:51.050
It's the ruby!

00:18:14.100 --> 00:18:15.300
D'Or...

00:18:15.300 --> 00:18:17.200
The people of D'Or have revived!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.100
It's as if we're dreaming...

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:20.200
It's real.

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:24.400
Unless we're all having the same dream, that is.

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:26.500
Manus! Your voice!

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:27.500
Yeah.

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:30.400
Because Thaegan has died, the curse has lifted!

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:31.400
Manus!

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:37.700
The people of Raladin and D'Or thank you all.

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:40.600
Especially that amazing bird.

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:51.700
I'm Nanion, and this is my wife Ethena.

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:53.770
We are the chiefs of D'Or.

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:58.700
Thanks to you all, we have been released from the sorceress' curse.

00:19:00.400 --> 00:19:02.800
You were looking for this, right?

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.100
Y...Yes.

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:08.600
We're all very grateful.

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:12.600
We have long since suffered under the sorceress' curse,

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:14.900
And now we're finally free!

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.300
That's...

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.700
Isn't that the Belt of Deltora?

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:26.400
Why is it here?

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:29.100
No, that I won't ask.

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:33.100
But it seems that you only have one gem.

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:36.100
Thanks to you, now there are two!

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:42.100
<i>Lief obtained the second gem, the ruby.</i>

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.300
Is that right?

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:49.600
It's exactly as I've feared.

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:53.700
Before we were pulled into the darkness, Thaegan said it:

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:59.000
"This world has been conquered by the Shadow Lord. Deltora has fallen."

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:01.900
That's not true. It hasn't fallen.

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:06.900
It's going to be restored, just like the people of D'Or.

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:09.600
It's exactly as you say.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:15.000
As long as those with courage don't lose hope, justice will prevail.

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:25.700
What's that?

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:28.300
The bell of happiness.

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:52.000
<i>Afterwards, they returned to Raladin, welcomed by the cheers of the Ralads who had regained their voices.</i>

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:53.700
Everyone...

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:55.500
Didn't your voices come back?

00:20:56.300 --> 00:21:00.400
When we're filled with happiness, we express it through music!

00:21:02.600 --> 00:21:05.400
Everyone, thank you so much.

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:07.700
Words can't express our gratitude enough.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:08.600
Thank you.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:10.500
Thank you!

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:13.300
Thank you so much!

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:14.800
You're welcome.

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:17.900
Lief, Barda, Jasmine.

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:19.600
I truly thank you!

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:22.400
I'll never forget you all.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:34.000
What? That Thaegan?!

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:36.400
Thaegan is dead, you say?!

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:39.700
That foolish woman...

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:44.100
The fool is <i>you</i> !

00:21:44.100 --> 00:21:45.300
Yes sir!

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:49.300
The topaz was stolen from the Forest of Silence,

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:52.100
The ruby was stolen from the Lake of Tears,

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:54.900
And yet we still don't know who's behind it...

00:21:56.300 --> 00:22:00.300
Were there no suspects in the city of Del?!

00:22:00.300 --> 00:22:04.000
Yes sir, I will have it investigated this instant!

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:06.200
You yourself shall do it!

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:07.700
Yes sir!

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:10.500
Rat, bring the ring here.

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:15.700
I still have use for this sorceress.

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:18.300
I will give her new life.

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:41.250
Cherry blossom flowers are fluttering down
Sakura maiochite yuku

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:46.920
As if they were peeled from the sky
Sora kara hagareru you ni

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:52.880
I'm gripping and holding hard
Anata to ita omoide ha

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:58.650
The memories I have with you
Zutto gyutto dakishimeteru kara

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:05.950
All of a sudden, flower petals are in full bloom
Futto maue ni ukabu no ha

00:23:06.430 --> 00:23:09.550
They're floating right above me
Mankai no hanabira

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:17.330
No matter how long I wait, no one is coming
Mattetatte mou daremo konai

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:24.300
Have I really left my wavering feelings behind?
Yureru omoi ha oitekitandeshou

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:32.540
I'm all alone right here, singing a song about cherry blossoms
Sakura uta utai nagara

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:38.480
Just waiting for no one else but you
Anata wo matsu watashi ha hitori

00:23:38.800 --> 00:23:44.490
This love has taught something to me:
Kono koi ga oshiete kureta

00:23:44.890 --> 00:23:50.800
That true love is hidden on ordinary days
Heibon na hibi koso ai to

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:59.010
I present my last song to the spring breeze
Harukaze ni saigo no uta wo

00:24:06.900 --> 00:24:08.700
Sorceress Thaegan.

00:24:08.700 --> 00:24:10.500
Beautiful and cruel.

00:24:10.500 --> 00:24:14.800
She is a powerful sorceress who commands evil magic in the north.

00:24:14.800 --> 00:24:17.500
She envies beautiful things and places curses on them.

00:24:17.500 --> 00:24:19.600
She enjoys feasting on black birds.

00:24:20.600 --> 00:24:22.800
Thaegan's children attacked us.

00:24:23.200 --> 00:24:28.000
We were caught in their trap; will we able to escape?

00:24:28.000 --> 00:24:30.780
And the man we ran into where we stopped.

00:24:32.200 --> 00:24:34.670
Next time, 'Tom's Curious Shop'.
Tom's Curious Shop
